"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d0/Belonging-301304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">竹制书箧<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bamboo Book Basket</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.7<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>竹编箱笼，可以遮风挡雨的苫布，隐秘而空旷，离群且安静，或许某些时刻显得孤独，但一直十分充盈。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/94/Belonging-301305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">双齿迎春花簪<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Flower Hairpin</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.34<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚黄色迎春花双齿簪，沉默寡言，一如既往，目送了冬日的消逝。如诗歌一般永恒存续。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/38/Belonging-301306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">雀与花<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Chickadee and Flower</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>这里的诗与昨日的有所区别，但山雀只是山雀。它依然啁啾着，飞往更远、更为长久的时间。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 山中一日1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 山中一日2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">山中一日 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Day in the Mountain</small></span></span>"}}